conception of a wave of frequency v,/V1—f* and velocity c/f associated with 
the particle which he easily showed would always keep in phase with the ‘inter- 
nal’ frequency v, V1—? as viewed from the stationary frame. The wavelength 
associated with the wave is h/p, where p is the momentum of the particle, 


